	<xsd:simpleType name="StandardAustralianFlatOrUnitType">
		<xsd:annotation>
			<xsd:documentation>
Purpose - Define flat or unit types as per Australian Standard AS4590 

Enumeration list
Antenna: ANT, Apartment: APT, Automated Teller Machine: ATM, Barbecue: BBQ, Boatshed: BTSD, Building: BLDG, Bungalow: BNGW
Cage: CAGE, Carpark: CARP, Carspace: CARS, Club: CLUB, Coolroom: COOL, Cottage: CTGE,Duplex: DUPL
Factory: FCTY, Flat: FLAT, Garage: GRGE, Hall: HALL, House: HSE, Kiosk: KSK, Lease: LSE, Lobby: LBBY
Loft: LOFT, Lot: LOT, Maisonette: MSNT, Marine Berth: MBTH, Office: OFFC, Reserve: RESV, Room: ROOM
Shed: SHED, Shop: SHOP, Showroom: SHRM, Sign: SIGN, Site: SITE, Stall: STLL, Store: STOR, Strata unit: STR
Studio: STU, Studio Apartment : STA , Substation: SUBS, Suite: SE, Tenancy: TNCY, Tower: TWR, Townhouse: TNHS
Unit: UNIT, Vault: VLT, Villa: VLLA, Ward: WARD, Warehouse: WHSE, Workshop: WKSH

Note: abbreviation for Studo Apartment (STA), was not defined in Standard AS4590 hence 'STA' was defined as part of design decision

	</xsd:documentation>
		</xsd:annotation>
