	<xsd:simpleType name="StandardAustralianFloorOrLevelType">
		<xsd:annotation>
			<xsd:documentation>
Purpose - Define floor or level types as per Australian Standard AS4590 
Enumeration List: 
Basement: B, Floor: FL, Ground: G, Level: L, Lower Ground Floor: LG, Lower Level: LL, Mezzanine: M, Observation Deck: OD, Parking: P
Penthouse: PTHS, Platform: PLF, Podium: PDM, Rooftop: RT, Sub-Basement: SB, Upper Ground Floor: UG

